      "message_id": "799a50f6-38e0-47e1-b2fc-57c6187cdb62",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Case CAPTURE2. Start a separate open-ended session called Events; preserve People. Seven further possibilities: the lamp failed on the night of the letter; the letter arrived before dawn; the story takes place in winter; the storm may conceal a signal; a shipwreck may occur; a blue light might be visible; a warning bell might sound. I accept the lamp failure. I decide the letter arrived before dawn. Establish winter as the story season. Keep storm versus clear weather as unresolved alternatives, and keep the shipwreck, blue light and bell unaccepted. Two questions remain open: Who finds the letter? When does Bjarni return? Do not answer them or add more ideas."
    },
